\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Malek_Stones\" title=\"Malek Stones\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2f/Portrait_Malek_Stones.png/25px-Portrait_Malek_Stones.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/2f/Portrait_Malek_Stones.png/38px-Portrait_Malek_Stones.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/2f/Portrait_Malek_Stones.png/50px-Portrait_Malek_Stones.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Malek Stones\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2f/Portrait_Malek_Stones.png/25px-Portrait_Malek_Stones.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/2f/Portrait_Malek_Stones.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Malek_Stones\" title=\"Malek Stones\">Malek Stones</a>, a columnist at <a href=\"/wiki/Baldur%27s_Mouth\" title=\"Baldur's Mouth\">Baldur's Mouth</a></li></ul>\n</div>  <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Text\"> Text </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-book-text\">\n<p>I'm writing to you, the magnificent Malek Stones, because I want you to know that your readers are behind you all the way!\n</p><p><br>\nWe're behind you because you tell us the stories behind the stories, the truths that 'they' want covered up and hidden! (You know <a href=\"/wiki/Volo\" title=\"Volo\">who</a> I mean.)\n</p><p><br>\nSo keep doing it, Saer Stones, keep digging up the facts no matter how deep in the dung they're buried, and don't let anyone stop you from speaking the TRUTH.\n</p><p><br>\nYour fan, Churg Elvek\n</p>\n</div>    \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714202622\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.061 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.064 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1782/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 25779/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 7087/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 29/200\nExpensive p